From f994d4d1df5e72b6697876bf233ac882069df3e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bench <bench@local>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 22:54:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] null patch: 53-per-bot-prediction-overlay

The shared World holds server data only. A bot's predicted blocks live in its own
BlockStatePredictionHandler (moved to azalea-world) and are read through BotWorld.
Server updates always write the shared world. Chunk packets and chunk forgets turn a bot's
overrides off, a dimension change resets the handler (ClientPacketListener#handleRespawn).
Collision tests once per query for an override in its box. Spec: B6 4.10.
